41379::$$$message_0288_0000_0000$$$::"Back in the day, people used to say,[br]'whatever happens, happens.'"::
41380::$$$message_0288_0001_0000$$$::"At this point, it should be best to obediently surrender to your fate."::
41381::$$$message_0288_0002_0000$$$::"Yeah, if I were to explain my state of mind..."::
41382::$$$message_0288_0003_0000$$$::"You should finish off the year's worth of unfinished business you have, throw your arms up in abandonment while lying on your back as proof of obedience, and then tighten your loincloth and take a great leap of faith in ceremonial funeral clothes!":©ü